WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.870
Coal, oil and gas took
millions of years to form,

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.370
and one day they will run out.

3
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.570
Burning them puts carbon
dioxide into the air.

4
00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:12.550
The wind, on the other
hand, blows again tomorrow,

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.050
and the day after, for ever.

6
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.870
Nobody has to dig it up or pay for it.

7
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.110
So why don't we simply
run everything on wind?

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.650
In this mission, you'll sort
energy resources into renewable

9
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.630
and non-renewable, and find
out what makes each one so.

10
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.990
You'll weigh up the problems
that come with every resource,

11
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.830
and see why no choice is perfect.

12
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.950
Your mission: work out why we
can't simply run everything on

13
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:39.930
wind.
